<title>SPAIN: BASKETBALL-YUGOSLAVIA WIN EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-YUGOSLAVIA WIN EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA, Spain 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yugoslavia retained the men's European basketball championship on Sunday by beating Italy 61-49 in the final.</p>
</text>
